  "identity": {
    "text": "Are you ready for our school's environment event next week?\n\nI have made a sign about litter near the river. After lunch, paper and plastic are often left beside the path. We need to protect the wildlife there.\n\nShall we call the activity a cleanup? I have gloves for twelve students, and the rubbish will be collected in bags.\n\nI also have a box for clean metal cans. In our school's program, those cans are accepted for recycling. Can we recycle plastic there too?\n\nWhat about the old wood from the garden signs? Could we reuse it instead of buying new material?\n\nI want to add a display about renewable energy. The science class has a small model that uses sunlight to power a lamp.\n\nI will make a second card about ecology and conservation, too. It can ask visitors how their choices affect a natural place.",
    "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
    "rate": "-15%",
